    "Subject": "[{CompanyName}] \u015Eifreniz {DaysToExpire} g\u00FCn i\u00E7inde sona erecek",
    "HtmlBody": "\u003Chtml\u003E\r\n\u003Cbody style=\u0022font-family: \u0027Segoe UI\u0027, Arial, sans-serif; color: #222; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 14px;\u0022\u003E\r\n\r\n  \u003C!-- T\u00DCRK\u00C7E B\u00D6L\u00DCM --\u003E\r\n  \u003Cp\u003ESay\u0131n \u003Cstrong\u003E{Name}\u003C/strong\u003E,\u003C/p\u003E\r\n  \r\n  \u003Cp\u003EKurumsal hesap \u015Fifrenizin (\u003Cstrong\u003E{UserName}\u003C/strong\u003E) \u003Cstrong\u003E{DaysToExpire} g\u00FCn\u003C/strong\u003E i\u00E7inde (\u003Cstrong\u003E{ExpiryDate}\u003C/strong\u003E tarihinde) s\u00FCresi dolacakt\u0131r.\u003C/p\u003E\r\n  \r\n  \u003Cp\u003EEri\u015Fiminizin kesilmemesi i\u00E7in l\u00FCtfen \u015Fifrenizi s\u00FCresi dolmadan yenileyiniz.\u003C/p\u003E\r\n  \r\n  \u003Cp style=\u0022margin-bottom: 5px;\u0022\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENas\u0131l de\u011Fi\u015Ftirebilirsiniz?\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\r\n  \u003Cul style=\u0022margin-top: 5px;\u0022\u003E\r\n    \u003Cli\u003EKurumsal bilgisayar\u0131n\u0131zda \u003Cstrong\u003ECtrl \u002B Alt \u002B Delete\u003C/strong\u003E \u0026rarr; \u003Cem\u003E\u015Eifreyi De\u011Fi\u015Ftir\u003C/em\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\r\n    \u003Cli\u003Eveya web \u00FCzerinden de\u011Fi\u015Ftirmek i\u00E7in: \u003Ca href=\u0022https://passwordreset.microsoftonline.com/\u0022 style=\u0022color: #0066cc; text-decoration: underline;\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EMicrosoft \u015Eifre S\u0131f\u0131rlama Portal\u0131\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\r\n  \u003C/ul\u003E\r\n\r\n  \u003Cdiv style=\u0022background-color: #f8f9fa; border-left: 4px solid #0056b3; padding: 12px; margin: 15px 0;\u0022\u003E\r\n    \u003Cp style=\u0022margin-top: 0; font-weight: bold; color: #0056b3;\u0022\u003E\u015Eifre Politikas\u0131 Hat\u0131rlatmas\u0131:\u003C/p\u003E\r\n    \u003Cul style=\u0022margin-bottom: 0; padding-left: 20px;\u0022\u003E\r\n      \u003Cli\u003EEn az 10 karakter uzunlu\u011Funda olmal\u0131d\u0131r\u003C/li\u003E\r\n      \u003Cli\u003EK\u00FC\u00E7\u00FCk harf i\u00E7ermelidir (a, b, c...)\u003C/li\u003E\r\n      \u003Cli\u003EB\u00FCy\u00FCk harf i\u00E7ermelidir (A, B, C...)\u003C/li\u003E\r\n      \u003Cli\u003ERakam i\u00E7ermelidir (0, 1, 2...)\u003C/li\u003E\r\n      \u003Cli\u003E\u00D6zel karakter i\u00E7ermelidir (\u0026amp;, !, @...)\u003C/li\u003E\r\n      \u003Cli\u003E\u0130sminizi veya \u003Cstrong\u003E\u0026ldquo;Corendon\u0026rdquo;\u003C/strong\u003E kelimesini i\u00E7eremez\u003C/li\u003E\r\n      \u003Cli\u003ESon 5 \u015Fifrenizle ayn\u0131 olamaz\u003C/li\u003E\r\n    \u003C/ul\u003E\r\n  \u003C/div\u003E\r\n\r\n  \u003Cp\u003ESon \u015Fifre de\u011Fi\u015Fiminiz: \u003Cstrong\u003E{LastPasswordSet}\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\r\n  \r\n  \u003Cp style=\u0022color: #555; font-size: 13px;\u0022\u003EBu mesaj otomatik g\u00F6nderilmi\u015Ftir. Yard\u0131m i\u00E7in IT Destek ile ileti\u015Fime ge\u00E7iniz.\u003C/p\u003E\r\n\r\n  \u003C!-- D\u0130L AYRACI --\u003E\r\n  \u003Chr style=\u0022border: 0; border-top: 2px dashed #ccc; margin: 30px 0;\u0022 /\u003E\r\n\r\n  \u003C!-- ENGLISH SECTION --\u003E\r\n  \u003Cp\u003EDear \u003Cstrong\u003E{Name}\u003C/strong\u003E,\u003C/p\u003E\r\n  \r\n  \u003Cp\u003EYour corporate account password (\u003Cstrong\u003E{UserName}\u003C/strong\u003E) will expire in \u003Cstrong\u003E{DaysToExpire} days\u003C/strong\u003E (on \u003Cstrong\u003E{ExpiryDate}\u003C/strong\u003E).\u003C/p\u003E\r\n  \r\n  \u003Cp\u003EPlease renew your password before it expires to avoid any access interruption.\u003C/p\u003E\r\n  \r\n  \u003Cp style=\u0022margin-bottom: 5px;\u0022\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EHow to change your password?\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\r\n  \u003Cul style=\u0022margin-top: 5px;\u0022\u003E\r\n    \u003Cli\u003EOn your corporate computer: \u003Cstrong\u003ECtrl \u002B Alt \u002B Delete\u003C/strong\u003E \u0026rarr; \u003Cem\u003EChange a password\u003C/em\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\r\n    \u003Cli\u003Eor online via: \u003Ca href=\u0022https://passwordreset.microsoftonline.com/\u0022 style=\u0022color: #0066cc; text-decoration: underline;\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022\u003EMicrosoft Password Reset Portal\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\r\n  \u003C/ul\u003E\r\n\r\n  \u003Cdiv style=\u0022background-color: #f8f9fa; border-left: 4px solid #d9534f; padding: 12px; margin: 15px 0;\u0022\u003E\r\n    \u003Cp style=\u0022margin-top: 0; font-weight: bold; color: #d9534f;\u0022\u003EPassword Policy Reminder:\u003C/p\u003E\r\n    \u003Cul style=\u0022margin-bottom: 0; padding-left: 20px;\u0022\u003E\r\n      \u003Cli\u003EMust be at least 10 characters long\u003C/li\u003E\r\n      \u003Cli\u003EMust contain lowercase letters (a, b, c...)\u003C/li\u003E\r\n      \u003Cli\u003EMust contain uppercase letters (A, B, C...)\u003C/li\u003E\r\n      \u003Cli\u003EMust contain numbers (0, 1, 2...)\u003C/li\u003E\r\n      \u003Cli\u003EMust contain special characters (\u0026amp;, !, @...)\u003C/li\u003E\r\n      \u003Cli\u003EMust not contain your name or the word \u003Cstrong\u003E\u0026ldquo;Corendon\u0026rdquo;\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\r\n      \u003Cli\u003ECannot be one of your last 5 passwords\u003C/li\u003E\r\n    \u003C/ul\u003E\r\n  \u003C/div\u003E\r\n\r\n  \u003Cp\u003EYour last password change: \u003Cstrong\u003E{LastPasswordSet}\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\r\n  \r\n  \u003Cp style=\u0022color: #555; font-size: 13px;\u0022\u003EThis is an automated message. Please contact IT Support if you need assistance.\u003C/p\u003E\r\n\r\n  \u003C!-- \u0130MZA / FOOTER --\u003E\r\n  \u003Cp style=\u0022color: #666; font-size: 12px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 10px; margin-top: 20px;\u0022\u003E\r\n    \u003Cstrong\u003E{CompanyName}\u003C/strong\u003E \u0026mdash; Bilgi Teknolojileri / IT Department\r\n  \u003C/p\u003E\r\n\u003C/body\u003E\r\n\u003C/html\u003E"
  },
